<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστόμ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outlet, opening,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.590f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.750
			</span></i>; <i>inosculation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>UP</u>
				6.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>patency,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>opening up</i> or <i>keeping open,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.119C.
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμορροίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.58
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ εἰς ἀ. βρώματα</span>
			<i>appetizing</i> foods (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστομόω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.132f
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ δῆξις,</span> of
			manures, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.17.6
			</span></i>.</div>
